      <title>Biped Gait - Walking Robot </title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/LukeAndWinters/hugo_3_backup/projects/bipedgait/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/LukeAndWinters/hugo_3_backup/projects/bipedgait/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;demo-of-best-walking-parameters&#34;&gt;Demo of Best Walking Parameters&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;450&#34; &#xA;  src=&#34;https://youtu.be/w4rrLuDohJY&#34; &#xA;  title=&#34;Bipedal Robot Video&#34; &#xA;  frameborder=&#34;0&#34; &#xA;  allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#34; &#xA;  allowfullscreen&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Very simple robotic gait, still need to implement feedback control.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;showcase-of-different-walking-parameters-effect-on-bipedal-gait&#34;&gt;Showcase of different walking Parameters effect on Bipedal Gait&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;450&#34; &#xA;  src=&#34;https://youtu.be/WKo5jZlnQE4&#34; &#xA;  title=&#34;Bipedal Robot Video&#34; &#xA;  frameborder=&#34;0&#34; &#xA;  allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#34; &#xA;  allowfullscreen&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Shows the effects of Stride Delay, Stride Height and Stride Length on the robotic gait. Also has IMU attached to head,so average out acceleration datea is plotted for a 10 second step period for comparison.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
